    <string name="about_media_folder_for_packages">Media folder for imported packages</string>
    <string name="about_media_folder_hint">ultimateVE keeps its files in its own subfolder, called ultimateVE, inside the folder you choose (nothing is put loose in the folder itself). Footage that comes inside a LumaFusion package is copied to ultimateVE/Media, in one folder per project, so you can see and manage the files (a USB drive or SD card works too). Project backups (.uvbundle) open the file picker in ultimateVE/Project-Backups. Deleting a project never deletes these files.</string>
